==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Descriptions TotK}}
{{Stub|TotK}}
The Cap of Twilight is found inside a [[Stone Chest]] in the [[Gleeok Den]] in the [[Akkala Highlands Depths]]. This Stone Chest is covered in [[Gloom]] and cannot be opened until the [[Gloom-Wreathed Enemy|Gloom-Wreathed]] [[King Gleeok]] in the Den is defeated.

